msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule|rdfs:label"
msgid "Rule"
msgstr "规则"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule|skos:definition"
msgid "A productive Horn or stratified-negation derivation whose logic:head is entailed when every positive logic:body atom holds, every logic:negatedBody atom is absent in its declared closure, and every guard succeeds. It is not a general logic:Formula or an integrity logic:Constraint: constructs outside the rule fragment remain formula trees and are carried as projection residue rather than approximated."
msgstr "一种能产生结论的 Horn 或分层否定推导：当每个正向 logic:body 原子成立、每个 logic:negatedBody 原子在其声明的闭包中均不存在且所有守卫都成功时，其 logic:head 被蕴涵。它既不是一般的 logic:Formula，也不是完整性 logic:Constraint；规则片段之外的构造仍保留为公式树，并作为投影残留携带，而不会被近似替代。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule|skos:example"
msgid "A rule can derive ex:ancestor(x,z) from ex:parent(x,y) and ex:ancestor(y,z), with its variables bound positively in the body."
msgstr "一条规则可以由 ex:parent(x,y) 与 ex:ancestor(y,z) 推导 ex:ancestor(x,z)，其中变量在规则体中被正向绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not encode disjunction, strong negation, or an unstratified negative cycle as a Horn rule."
msgstr "不要把析取、强否定或未分层的否定循环编码成 Horn 规则。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Provide one head, the positive and optional stratified-negative body atoms, and any explicit guards or aggregate specification."
msgstr "提供一个规则头、正向规则体原子、可选的分层否定规则体原子，以及任何显式守卫或聚合规范。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Rule|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use for productive Horn, existential-rule, or stratified-negation derivations."
msgstr "用于能产生结论的 Horn 推导、存在规则推导或分层否定推导。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|rdfs:label"
msgid "Term Carrier"
msgstr "词项载体"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|skos:definition"
msgid "An ordered slot in an atomic formula's logic:argument list or a quantifier's logic:quantifiedVariable block. It carries exactly one zero-based logic:termIndex and exactly one value kind: logic:termIri, logic:termVariable, logic:termLiteral, or logic:termSequenceMarker. It is not the term value itself; it is the RDF node that preserves the value's kind and position independently of triple order."
msgstr "原子公式的 logic:argument 列表或量词的 logic:quantifiedVariable 块中的一个有序位置。它恰好携带一个从零开始的 logic:termIndex，以及恰好一种值类型：logic:termIri、logic:termVariable、logic:termLiteral 或 logic:termSequenceMarker。它不是词项值本身，而是一个 RDF 节点，用于在不依赖三元组顺序的情况下保留值的类型和位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|skos:example"
msgid "An atom's second argument can be represented by a carrier with logic:termIndex 1 and logic:termVariable 'object'."
msgstr "一个原子的第二个论元可以由携带 logic:termIndex 1 与 logic:termVariable 'object' 的载体表示。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not place two value kinds on one carrier or infer its position from Turtle serialization order."
msgstr "不要在同一个载体上放置两种值类型，也不要从 Turtle 序列化顺序推断其位置。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Assign one contiguous zero-based index and one of the four exclusive term-value predicates."
msgstr "分配一个从零开始且连续的索引，并选择四个互斥词项值谓词中的一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrier|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use for each ordered atom argument and each ordered quantifier binding."
msgstr "用于每个有序的原子论元以及每个有序的量词绑定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/FormulaConstructorConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Formula Constructor Constraint"
msgstr "公式构造器约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/FormulaConstructorConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Requires every logic:Formula to select exactly one constructor family: atomic relation, strong negation, conjunction, disjunction, material implication (keyed by logic:antecedent), biconditional, universal quantification, or existential quantification. It does not choose among serialized operands; it prevents one node from having two incompatible logical meanings."
msgstr "要求每个 logic:Formula 恰好选择一个构造器族：原子关系、强否定、合取、析取、实质蕴含（由 logic:antecedent 标识）、双条件、全称量化或存在量化。它不在已序列化的操作数之间作选择；它防止同一节点同时具有两种不相容的逻辑含义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/FormulaConstructorConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "A node with both logic:relation and logic:not violates this constraint because it cannot be both an atom and a negation."
msgstr "同时具有 logic:relation 与 logic:not 的节点违反此约束，因为它不能既是原子又是否定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/FormulaConstructorConstraint|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not use this constraint to limit how many operands a selected constructor carries; arity is a separate typed-IR invariant."
msgstr "不要用此约束限制所选构造器携带的操作数数量；元数是一个独立的类型化 IR 不变量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/FormulaConstructorConstraint|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Validate every authored formula tree before lowering it; reject a focus node unless exactly one listed constructor predicate is present."
msgstr "在降低之前验证每棵已创作的公式树；除非焦点节点恰好具有一个列出的构造器谓词，否则拒绝该节点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/FormulaConstructorConstraint|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use when validating canonical RDF formula trees before parsing, canonicalization, or projection."
msgstr "用于在解析、规范化或投影之前验证规范 RDF 公式树。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationConsequentConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Implication Consequent Constraint"
msgstr "蕴含后件约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationConsequentConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Requires a logic:Formula carrying logic:antecedent to carry logic:consequent as the ordered second operand of the same material implication. It is not a rule that derives a consequent; it is a structural integrity condition on the implication node."
msgstr "要求携带 logic:antecedent 的 logic:Formula 同时携带 logic:consequent，作为同一实质蕴含中有序的第二个操作数。它不是推导后件的规则，而是施加于蕴含节点的结构完整性条件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationConsequentConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "An implication node with an antecedent atom but no consequent formula violates this constraint."
msgstr "具有前件原子但没有后件公式的蕴含节点违反此约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationConsequentConstraint|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not read the required edge as logical modus ponens; it only completes the serialized constructor."
msgstr "不要把所需边理解为逻辑上的肯定前件式；它只用于补全已序列化的构造器。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationConsequentConstraint|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "When logic:antecedent is present, require one resource-valued logic:consequent before constructing Formula::Implies."
msgstr "当 logic:antecedent 存在时，在构造 Formula::Implies 之前要求一个以资源为值的 logic:consequent。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationConsequentConstraint|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use when validating the ordered pair that encodes material implication."
msgstr "用于验证编码实质蕴含的有序对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationAntecedentConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Implication Antecedent Constraint"
msgstr "蕴含前件约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationAntecedentConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Requires a logic:Formula carrying logic:consequent to carry logic:antecedent as the ordered first operand of the same material implication. It is not an inverse entailment from conclusion to premise; it is the reverse structural completeness check for the serialized pair."
msgstr "要求携带 logic:consequent 的 logic:Formula 同时携带 logic:antecedent，作为同一实质蕴含中有序的第一个操作数。它不是从结论到前提的逆向蕴涵，而是对已序列化有序对进行的反向结构完整性检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationAntecedentConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "A formula node with a consequent formula but no antecedent formula violates this constraint."
msgstr "具有后件公式但没有前件公式的公式节点违反此约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationAntecedentConstraint|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not use the constraint to infer that a consequent semantically entails its antecedent."
msgstr "不要用此约束推断后件在语义上蕴涵其前件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationAntecedentConstraint|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "When logic:consequent is present, require one resource-valued logic:antecedent before constructing Formula::Implies."
msgstr "当 logic:consequent 存在时，在构造 Formula::Implies 之前要求一个以资源为值的 logic:antecedent。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ImplicationAntecedentConstraint|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use with logic:ImplicationConsequentConstraint to validate both halves of an implication."
msgstr "与 logic:ImplicationConsequentConstraint 配合使用，以验证蕴含的两个部分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Term Carrier Value Constraint"
msgstr "词项载体值约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Requires every logic:TermCarrier to carry exactly one term-value kind: IRI, variable, literal, or sequence marker. It does not constrain the carrier's ordinal; logic:termIndex and list-level contiguity are checked independently."
msgstr "要求每个 logic:TermCarrier 恰好携带一种词项值类型：IRI、变量、字面量或序列标记。它不约束载体的序号；logic:termIndex 与列表层级的连续性会被独立检查。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "A carrier with both logic:termIri ex:a and logic:termVariable 'a' violates this constraint even though the spellings resemble one another."
msgstr "同时具有 logic:termIri ex:a 与 logic:termVariable 'a' 的载体违反此约束，即使两者的拼写相似。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not collapse IRI, variable, literal, and sequence-marker values into a shared string field; their kinds affect formula meaning."
msgstr "不要把 IRI、变量、字面量和序列标记值压缩进同一个字符串字段；它们的类型会影响公式含义。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Reject a carrier unless exactly one of the four term-value predicates has exactly one value."
msgstr "除非四个词项值谓词中恰好有一个且仅有一个值，否则拒绝该载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierValueConstraint|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use whenever an RDF argument or quantifier-binding carrier is reconstructed as a typed IR term."
msgstr "每当 RDF 论元或量词绑定载体被重建为类型化 IR 词项时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierIndexConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Term Carrier Index Constraint"
msgstr "词项载体索引约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierIndexConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Requires every declared logic:TermCarrier to carry a logic:termIndex. It is not the list-level ordering check: uniqueness and zero-based contiguity are verified across all sibling carriers by the typed-IR frontend."
msgstr "要求每个已声明的 logic:TermCarrier 都携带 logic:termIndex。它不是列表层级的排序检查；类型化 IR 前端会跨所有同级载体验证索引的唯一性以及从零开始的连续性。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierIndexConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "A logic:TermCarrier with logic:termVariable 'x' but no logic:termIndex violates this constraint."
msgstr "具有 logic:termVariable 'x' 但没有 logic:termIndex 的 logic:TermCarrier 违反此约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierIndexConstraint|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not infer an omitted index from RDF statement order, which has no semantic ordering."
msgstr "不要从 RDF 语句顺序推断省略的索引，因为该顺序没有语义上的次序。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierIndexConstraint|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Require one non-negative integer index on each carrier, then validate the sibling index set as 0 through n minus 1."
msgstr "要求每个载体具有一个非负整数索引，然后验证同级索引集合恰为从 0 到 n 减 1。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/TermCarrierIndexConstraint|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use when validating ordered argument lists and quantifier binding blocks."
msgstr "用于验证有序论元列表和量词绑定块。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/LiteralDatatypeConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Literal Datatype Constraint"
msgstr "字面量数据类型约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/LiteralDatatypeConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Requires a carrier with logic:termLiteralDatatype to carry logic:termLiteral, so a datatype IRI can never float without the lexical literal it types. It does not require a datatype for every literal; absence denotes a plain literal."
msgstr "要求具有 logic:termLiteralDatatype 的载体同时携带 logic:termLiteral，从而避免数据类型 IRI 脱离其所类型化的词法字面量而孤立存在。它不要求每个字面量都有数据类型；缺省表示普通字面量。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/LiteralDatatypeConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "A carrier with logic:termLiteralDatatype xsd:integer but no logic:termLiteral violates this constraint."
msgstr "具有 logic:termLiteralDatatype xsd:integer 但没有 logic:termLiteral 的载体违反此约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/LiteralDatatypeConstraint|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not attach logic:termLiteralDatatype to an IRI, variable, or sequence-marker carrier."
msgstr "不要把 logic:termLiteralDatatype 附加到 IRI、变量或序列标记载体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/LiteralDatatypeConstraint|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Accept zero or one datatype IRI only on a carrier whose sole value kind is logic:termLiteral."
msgstr "仅当载体唯一的值类型为 logic:termLiteral 时，才允许零个或一个数据类型 IRI。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/LiteralDatatypeConstraint|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use when reconstructing typed literal terms from their lexical and datatype components."
msgstr "用于从词法部分与数据类型部分重建有类型的字面量词项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConstraintSugar|rdfs:label"
msgid "Constraint Sugar"
msgstr "约束语法糖"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConstraintSugar|skos:definition"
msgid "An authoring descriptor that the logic frontend expands into one canonical logic:Constraint with a reified integrity formula. A constraint-sugar record names a closed validation pattern and its parameters; it is not itself a logic:Formula AST node, so formula constructor checks never mistake validation metadata for an object-level sentence."
msgstr "一种创作描述符，逻辑前端会将其展开为一个带有具象化完整性公式的规范 logic:Constraint。约束语法糖记录为封闭验证模式及其参数命名；它本身不是 logic:Formula 抽象语法树节点，因此公式构造器检查不会把验证元数据误当作对象层语句。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConstraintSugar|skos:example"
msgid "A logic:ChoiceGroupConstraint record can require exactly one of two predicates without being treated as either operand of the formula it compiles."
msgstr "一条 logic:ChoiceGroupConstraint 记录可以要求两个谓词中恰好出现一个，而不会被视为其所编译公式的任一操作数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConstraintSugar|gmeow:avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not use a sugar class when the integrity condition needs a formula shape the selected closed pattern cannot preserve."
msgstr "当完整性条件需要所选封闭模式无法保真的公式结构时，不要使用语法糖类。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConstraintSugar|gmeow:howToUse"
msgid "Select the narrowest sugar subclass, provide its target and pattern parameters, and inspect the compiled logic:Constraint projection."
msgstr "选择范围最窄的语法糖子类，提供其目标与模式参数，并检查编译后的 logic:Constraint 投影。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConstraintSugar|gmeow:useWhen"
msgid "Use for a supported closed-world validation pattern whose canonical expansion is deterministic."
msgstr "用于规范展开结果确定且受支持的封闭世界验证模式。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConversionTarget|rdfs:label"
msgid "Conversion Target"
msgstr "转换目标"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConversionTarget|skos:definition"
msgid "A legal output language for a lowering: every emitted construct must inhabit this target, while anything it cannot express remains explicit flagged residue. It is not a logic:ProjectionTarget, which requests a presentation of an answer; a conversion target instead delimits the IR or dialect into which canonical content may be legalized."
msgstr "降低过程所面向的合法输出语言：每个发出的构造都必须属于该目标，而无法表达的内容仍作为显式标记的残留保留。它不是请求答案呈现形式的 logic:ProjectionTarget；转换目标限定的是规范内容可被合法化到的 IR 或方言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ConversionTarget|skos:example"
msgid "logic:RelationalCore a logic:ConversionTarget ."
msgstr "例如：logic:RelationalCore a logic:ConversionTarget ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ChoiceGroupConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Choice Group Constraint"
msgstr "选择组约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ChoiceGroupConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for a choice-group cardinality constraint (P1): a logic:onClass target, a set of logic:choicePredicate predicates, and a logic:choiceMode ('exactly-one', 'at-most-one', or the 'exactly-one-of-N' alias of 'exactly-one'). The compiler expands it into a canonical logic:Constraint whose integrity is the XOR / at-most formula over the ∃-requiredness of each predicate. Frontend-only: it is not a new node kind, only an authoring shortcut."
msgstr "选择组基数约束（P1）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标、一组 logic:choicePredicate 谓词，以及 logic:choiceMode（'exactly-one'、'at-most-one'，或作为 'exactly-one' 别名的 'exactly-one-of-N'）。编译器将其展开为规范的 logic:Constraint，其完整性条件是各谓词存在性要求之上的异或或至多公式。它仅供前端创作使用，不是新的节点类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ChoiceGroupConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:contactChoice a logic:ChoiceGroupConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Contact ; logic:choicePredicate ex:email, ex:phone ; logic:choiceMode \"exactly-one\" ."
msgstr "例如：ex:contactChoice a logic:ChoiceGroupConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Contact ; logic:choicePredicate ex:email, ex:phone ; logic:choiceMode \"exactly-one\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/GuardedImplicationConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Guarded Implication Constraint"
msgstr "受守卫蕴含约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/GuardedImplicationConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for a guarded-implication constraint (P2): a logic:onClass target, a logic:trigger predicate (optionally pinned to a logic:triggerValue), and one or more logic:requires companion predicates. Expands to a canonical logic:Constraint ∀this. C(this) ∧ trigger(this, …) → ∃ companion. Frontend-only authoring shortcut."
msgstr "受守卫蕴含约束（P2）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标、一个可由 logic:triggerValue 固定的 logic:trigger 谓词，以及一个或多个 logic:requires 伴随谓词。它展开为规范的 logic:Constraint：∀x. C(x) ∧ trigger(x, …) → ∃y。它只是前端创作捷径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/GuardedImplicationConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:datedApproval a logic:GuardedImplicationConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Submission ; logic:trigger ex:approved ; logic:requires ex:approvalDate ."
msgstr "例如：ex:datedApproval a logic:GuardedImplicationConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Submission ; logic:trigger ex:approved ; logic:requires ex:approvalDate ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/DisjunctiveRequirednessConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Disjunctive Requiredness Constraint"
msgstr "析取必需性约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/DisjunctiveRequirednessConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for a disjunctive-requiredness constraint (P3): a logic:onClass target and a set of logic:anyOf predicates, at least one of which is required. Expands to a canonical logic:Constraint ∀this. C(this) → (∃p1 ∨ … ∨ ∃pn). Frontend-only authoring shortcut."
msgstr "析取必需性约束（P3）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标和一组 logic:anyOf 谓词，其中至少一个必须存在。它展开为规范的 logic:Constraint：∀x. C(x) → (∃p1 ∨ … ∨ ∃pn)。它只是前端创作捷径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/DisjunctiveRequirednessConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:contactRoute a logic:DisjunctiveRequirednessConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Contact ; logic:anyOf ex:email, ex:phone ."
msgstr "例如：ex:contactRoute a logic:DisjunctiveRequirednessConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Contact ; logic:anyOf ex:email, ex:phone ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/PathValueTypeConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Path Value Type Constraint"
msgstr "路径值类型约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/PathValueTypeConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for a path-value type-membership constraint (P4): a logic:onClass target, a logic:valuePath predicate, and a required logic:valueClass. Expands to a canonical logic:Constraint ∀this. C(this) → ∀v. P(this,v) → D(v). Frontend-only authoring shortcut."
msgstr "路径值类型成员约束（P4）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标、一个 logic:valuePath 谓词和必需的 logic:valueClass。它展开为规范的 logic:Constraint：∀x. C(x) → ∀v. P(x,v) → D(v)。它只是前端创作捷径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/PathValueTypeConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:memberType a logic:PathValueTypeConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Team ; logic:valuePath ex:member ; logic:valueClass ex:Person ."
msgstr "例如：ex:memberType a logic:PathValueTypeConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Team ; logic:valuePath ex:member ; logic:valueClass ex:Person ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/CrossNodeConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Cross Node Constraint"
msgstr "跨节点约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/CrossNodeConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for a cross-node co-occurrence / inequality constraint (P5): a logic:onClass target and two roles (logic:roleA, logic:roleB) that must, per logic:crossMode, either 'co-occur' (be present together) or 'differ' (never bind the same value). Expands to a canonical logic:Constraint whose integrity is the bi-implication (co-occur) or the join + inequality (differ, via the logic:termEqual filter relation). Frontend-only authoring shortcut."
msgstr "跨节点共现或不等约束（P5）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标和两个角色 logic:roleA、logic:roleB；它们依照 logic:crossMode 必须共同出现，或永不绑定同一值。它展开为规范的 logic:Constraint，其完整性条件是双蕴含，或通过 logic:termEqual 过滤关系形成的连接加不等式。它只是前端创作捷径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/CrossNodeConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:reviewRoles a logic:CrossNodeConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Review ; logic:roleA ex:author ; logic:roleB ex:reviewer ; logic:crossMode \"differ\" ."
msgstr "例如：ex:reviewRoles a logic:CrossNodeConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Review ; logic:roleA ex:author ; logic:roleB ex:reviewer ; logic:crossMode \"differ\" ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ForbiddenPatternConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Forbidden Pattern Constraint"
msgstr "禁用模式约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ForbiddenPatternConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for a forbidden-pattern constraint (P7): a logic:onClass target and a logic:forbiddenPredicate (optionally pinned to a logic:forbiddenValue). Expands to a canonical logic:Constraint ∀this. C(this) → ¬∃b. forbidden(this,b) (or the pinned-value form ¬ forbidden(this, value)). Frontend-only authoring shortcut."
msgstr "禁用模式约束（P7）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标和一个可固定到 logic:forbiddenValue 的 logic:forbiddenPredicate。它展开为规范的 logic:Constraint：∀x. C(x) → ¬∃b. forbidden(x,b)，或固定值形式 ¬ forbidden(x, value)。它只是前端创作捷径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/ForbiddenPatternConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:noDeprecatedCode a logic:ForbiddenPatternConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Submission ; logic:forbiddenPredicate ex:deprecatedCode ."
msgstr "例如：ex:noDeprecatedCode a logic:ForbiddenPatternConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Submission ; logic:forbiddenPredicate ex:deprecatedCode ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/AggregateConstraint|rdfs:label"
msgid "Aggregate Constraint"
msgstr "聚合约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/AggregateConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "Compact sugar for an aggregate-comparison constraint (P6): a logic:onClass target, an aggregate over a path (logic:aggFunction, optional logic:aggDistinct, logic:aggPath), a logic:aggComparator, and a logic:aggCompareTo right-hand side (a compared property IRI, or a literal). Expands to a canonical logic:Constraint carrying both the honest reified FOL integrity and a structured aggregate satellite, lowered to a SELECT $this … GROUP BY $this HAVING(…) sh:SPARQLConstraint. Frontend-only authoring shortcut."
msgstr "聚合比较约束（P6）的紧凑语法糖：包含一个 logic:onClass 目标、路径上的聚合（logic:aggFunction、可选的 logic:aggDistinct 与 logic:aggPath）、logic:aggComparator，以及作为被比较属性 IRI 或字面量的右端 logic:aggCompareTo。它展开为规范的 logic:Constraint，同时携带忠实具象化的 FOL 完整性条件与结构化聚合附属结构，并降低为带分组和聚合条件的 sh:SPARQLConstraint。它只是前端创作捷径。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/AggregateConstraint|skos:example"
msgid "ex:minimumMembers a logic:AggregateConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Team ; logic:aggFunction \"COUNT\" ; logic:aggPath ex:member ; logic:aggComparator \">=\" ; logic:aggCompareTo 2 ."
msgstr "例如：ex:minimumMembers a logic:AggregateConstraint ; logic:onClass ex:Team ; logic:aggFunction \"COUNT\" ; logic:aggPath ex:member ; logic:aggComparator \">=\" ; logic:aggCompareTo 2 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/GroundingCorrespondence|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Grounding Correspondence"
msgstr "基础对应"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/GroundingCorrespondence|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A logic:Correspondence owned by one of the three co-foundational grounding slices (logic:, math:, or lang:) and shipped as meta-level correspondence data in graph/correspondence-laws. Unlike an ordinary consumer mapping, every grounding correspondence explicitly declares its logic:morphismClass, logic:morphismKind, and logic:preservationKind, and names both related terms through logic:sourceEndpoint and logic:targetEndpoint. It remains outside object-level closure: external vocabularies are linked by reference and their TBoxes are never silently imported."
msgstr "由 logic:、math: 或 lang: 三个共同基础切片之一拥有并随 graph/correspondence-laws 发布的 logic:Correspondence。它显式声明映射类别、映射种类、保真等级及两个端点；外部词汇仅按引用连接，其 TBox 不会被静默导入对象层闭包。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sourceEndpoint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "source endpoint"
msgstr "源端点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sourceEndpoint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Names the canonical source term or pattern related by a logic:Correspondence. This is an endpoint, not an executable logic:getLeg: a term-level correspondence can name both endpoints while carrying no transaction program. Single-valued when present and paired with exactly one logic:targetEndpoint."
msgstr "命名 logic:Correspondence 所关联的规范源词项或模式。它是端点而不是可执行的 logic:getLeg；出现时只能有一个，并与恰好一个 logic:targetEndpoint 配对。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/targetEndpoint|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "target endpoint"
msgstr "目标端点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/targetEndpoint|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Names the external view term or pattern related by a logic:Correspondence. This is an endpoint, not an executable logic:putLeg. Grounding correspondences use it to retain the exact gUFO, BFO, OBO, SUMO, OWL, or SHACL term in the shipped carrier without importing that target ontology."
msgstr "命名 logic:Correspondence 所关联的外部视图词项或模式。它是端点而不是可执行的 logic:putLeg；它精确保留 gUFO、BFO、OBO、SUMO、OWL 或 SHACL 引用，而不导入目标本体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termIn|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "term in value set"
msgstr "词项属于值集"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The variadic relation used inside a reified logic:Formula to test whether its first term is a member of the remaining finite value-set arguments. The SHACL lowering realizes it as an sh:in list and the procedural SPARQL lowering as FILTER IN; it binds no term and is never interpreted as an RDF membership assertion."
msgstr "用于具象化 logic:Formula 的可变元关系，检验第一个词项是否属于其余参数组成的有限值集。它降低为 sh:in 或 FILTER IN，不绑定词项，也绝不解释为 RDF 成员断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termRegex|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "term regular expression"
msgstr "词项正则表达式"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/termRegex|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The relation used inside a reified logic:Formula to test a term's lexical form against a regular-expression argument. It lowers to SPARQL REGEX and, with an explicit regex-dialect residue, to sh:pattern; it is not an exact-preservation claim because the regex dialects differ."
msgstr "在具象化 logic:Formula 中用正则表达式检验词项词法形式的关系。它降低为 SPARQL REGEX，或带显式方言残留的 sh:pattern；由于正则方言不同，不能声称精确保真。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/directType|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "direct type guard"
msgstr "直接类型守卫"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/directType|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A guard-only relation inside a reified constraint formula selecting direct instances of a class while excluding instances reached only through subclasses. It is not a data-triple relation; the SHACL lowering consumes it to build a subclass-excluding sh:SPARQLTarget SELECT."
msgstr "具象化约束公式中的纯守卫关系，用于选择类的直接实例并排除仅经子类推得的实例。它不是数据三元组关系；SHACL 降低会据此生成排除子类的 sh:SPARQLTarget 查询。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sparqlTarget|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "SPARQL target guard"
msgstr "SPARQL 目标守卫"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sparqlTarget|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A guard-only relation inside a reified constraint formula whose second argument carries the SELECT text defining a focus set. It is not a data-triple relation; the SHACL lowering consumes it as a first-class sh:SPARQLTarget and removes the guard from the violation body."
msgstr "具象化约束公式中的纯守卫关系，其第二个参数携带定义焦点集合的 SELECT 文本。它不是数据三元组关系；SHACL 降低将其变为一等 sh:SPARQLTarget，并从违规主体中移除该守卫。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Restriction|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Restriction"
msgstr "限制"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Restriction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A canonical logic: class-expression restriction: a constraint over one logic:onProperty together with one or more value or cardinality constraints. OWL's owl:Restriction is a generated dialect form of this construct, not the canonical authoring term."
msgstr "规范的 logic: 类表达式限制：针对一个 logic:onProperty，并带有一个或多个值或基数约束。OWL 的 owl:Restriction 是该构造的生成方言形式，而不是规范创作词项。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Enumeration|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Enumeration"
msgstr "枚举"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Enumeration|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A finite class expression whose members are named by a logic:oneOf RDF list. It lowers to an OWL nominal (owl:oneOf) and remains first-class in logic: even when a weaker target profile cannot carry nominals."
msgstr "由 logic:oneOf RDF 列表命名成员的有限类表达式。它降低为 OWL 名词式，即使较弱的目标配置无法承载名词式，它在 logic: 中仍是一等构造。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Datarange|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Datarange"
msgstr "数据范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Datarange|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "A constrained datatype expression: one logic:onDatatype plus a logic:withRestrictions list of facet constraints. It is the canonical form lowered to OWL 2 datatype restrictions when the target can represent them, not a literal value or an unconstrained datatype name."
msgstr "受约束的数据类型表达式：一个 logic:onDatatype 加上一组 logic:withRestrictions 分面约束。它是可降低为 OWL 2 数据类型限制的规范形式，不是字面值或无约束的数据类型名称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/subClassOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "subclass of"
msgstr "是其子类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/subClassOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical class subsumption: every instance of the subject type is an instance of the object type. It is not a lexical hierarchy hint; it lowers to rdfs:subClassOf on the OWL/RDFS projection surface."
msgstr "规范类包含关系：主语类型的每个实例也是宾语类型的实例。它不是词汇层级提示；在 OWL/RDFS 投影中降低为 rdfs:subClassOf。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/equivalentClass|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "equivalent class"
msgstr "等价类"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/equivalentClass|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical extensional equivalence between two class expressions. It is not similarity or close matching; it lowers to owl:equivalentClass only when the selected projection can preserve the claim."
msgstr "两个类表达式之间的规范外延等价。它不是相似或近似匹配；只有所选投影能够保留该断言时，才降低为 owl:equivalentClass。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/disjointWith|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "disjoint with"
msgstr "与其互斥"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/disjointWith|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical class disjointness: no individual may instantiate both class expressions. Distinct from logic:disjoint, the mereological relation between individuals; lowers to owl:disjointWith."
msgstr "规范类互斥：任何个体都不能同时实例化两个类表达式。它不同于个体之间的部分论关系 logic:disjoint，并降低为 owl:disjointWith。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/subPropertyOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "subproperty of"
msgstr "是其子属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/subPropertyOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical relation subsumption: every pair related by the subject property is related by the object property. It is not a label hierarchy; it lowers to rdfs:subPropertyOf."
msgstr "规范关系包含：由主语属性关联的每一对也由宾语属性关联。它不是标签层级，并降低为 rdfs:subPropertyOf。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/equivalentProperty|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "equivalent property"
msgstr "等价属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/equivalentProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical extensional equivalence between two properties. It is not a related-property hint; it lowers to owl:equivalentProperty only when the projection preserves the full relation."
msgstr "两个属性之间的规范外延等价。它不是相关属性提示；只有投影保留完整关系时，才降低为 owl:equivalentProperty。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inverseOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "inverse of"
msgstr "是其逆关系"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inverseOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical inverse-relation declaration: P(x,y) holds exactly when Q(y,x) holds. It is not property equivalence because the argument order reverses; it lowers to owl:inverseOf."
msgstr "规范逆关系声明：P(x,y) 成立当且仅当 Q(y,x) 成立。由于参数顺序反转，它不是属性等价，并降低为 owl:inverseOf。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/domain|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "domain"
msgstr "定义域"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/domain|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical domain entailment for a property: using the property entails that its subject instantiates the named type. It is not a closed-world validation constraint; it lowers to rdfs:domain."
msgstr "属性的规范定义域蕴涵：使用该属性即可推出其主语实例化指定类型。它不是闭世界验证约束，并降低为 rdfs:domain。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/range|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "range"
msgstr "值域"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/range|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Canonical range entailment for a property: using the property entails that its object instantiates the named type or datatype. It is not a closed-world validation constraint; it lowers to rdfs:range."
msgstr "属性的规范值域蕴涵：使用该属性即可推出其宾语实例化指定类型或数据类型。它不是闭世界验证约束，并降低为 rdfs:range。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inverseFunctionalProperty|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "inverse-functional property"
msgstr "逆函数型属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/inverseFunctionalProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The logic: property-characteristic marker for inverse functionality: P(a,c) and P(b,c) entail a = b. It is not ordinary functionality, which constrains objects per subject; the OWL projection is owl:InverseFunctionalProperty."
msgstr "logic: 的逆函数性属性标记：P(a,c) 与 P(b,c) 蕴涵 a = b。它不是按主语约束宾语的普通函数性；OWL 投影为 owl:InverseFunctionalProperty。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/reflexiveProperty|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "reflexive property"
msgstr "自反属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/reflexiveProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The logic: property-characteristic marker for reflexivity: every individual in scope relates to itself through the property. It is not evidence that self-edges were explicitly asserted; the OWL projection is owl:ReflexiveProperty."
msgstr "logic: 的自反性属性标记：范围内每个个体都经该属性关联自身。它不表示自环被显式断言；OWL 投影为 owl:ReflexiveProperty。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/onProperty|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "on property"
msgstr "作用于属性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/onProperty|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Names the property constrained by a logic:Restriction. It is not an assertion using that property; it lowers to owl:onProperty."
msgstr "命名 logic:Restriction 所约束的属性。它不是使用该属性的数据断言，并降低为 owl:onProperty。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/someValuesFrom|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "some values from"
msgstr "某些值来自"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/someValuesFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Existential restriction value: at least one value reached through logic:onProperty belongs to the named class or datarange. It does not constrain every filler; it lowers to owl:someValuesFrom."
msgstr "存在限制值：经 logic:onProperty 到达的至少一个值属于指定类或数据范围。它不约束每个填充值，并降低为 owl:someValuesFrom。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/allValuesFrom|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "all values from"
msgstr "所有值来自"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/allValuesFrom|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Universal restriction value: every value reached through logic:onProperty belongs to the named class or datarange. It does not assert that any filler exists; it lowers to owl:allValuesFrom."
msgstr "全称限制值：经 logic:onProperty 到达的每个值都属于指定类或数据范围。它不断言任何填充值存在，并降低为 owl:allValuesFrom。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasValue|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "has value"
msgstr "具有值"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/hasValue|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Value restriction requiring the logic:onProperty relation to contain one named IRI or literal. It is not a range declaration; it lowers to owl:hasValue."
msgstr "要求 logic:onProperty 关系包含某个指定 IRI 或字面值的值限制。它不是值域声明，并降低为 owl:hasValue。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/minCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "minimum cardinality"
msgstr "最小基数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/minCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The inclusive minimum number of logic:onProperty values required by an unqualified logic:Restriction. It does not filter fillers by class or datarange; it lowers to owl:minCardinality."
msgstr "非限定 logic:Restriction 所要求的 logic:onProperty 值的含端点最小数量。它不按类或数据范围筛选填充值，并降低为 owl:minCardinality。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/maxCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "maximum cardinality"
msgstr "最大基数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/maxCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The inclusive maximum number of logic:onProperty values permitted by an unqualified logic:Restriction. It does not filter fillers by class or datarange; it lowers to owl:maxCardinality."
msgstr "非限定 logic:Restriction 所允许的 logic:onProperty 值的含端点最大数量。它不按类或数据范围筛选填充值，并降低为 owl:maxCardinality。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/cardinality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "cardinality"
msgstr "基数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/cardinality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact number of logic:onProperty values required by an unqualified logic:Restriction. It does not filter fillers by class or datarange; it lowers to owl:cardinality."
msgstr "非限定 logic:Restriction 所要求的 logic:onProperty 值的精确数量。它不按类或数据范围筛选填充值，并降低为 owl:cardinality。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/qualifiedCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "qualified cardinality"
msgstr "限定基数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/qualifiedCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The exact number of logic:onProperty values belonging to the qualifying logic:onClass or logic:onDataRange. It does not count fillers outside that qualifier; it lowers to owl:qualifiedCardinality."
msgstr "属于限定 logic:onClass 或 logic:onDataRange 的 logic:onProperty 值的精确数量。限定范围外的填充值不计入，并降低为 owl:qualifiedCardinality。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/minQualifiedCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "minimum qualified cardinality"
msgstr "最小限定基数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/minQualifiedCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The inclusive minimum number of logic:onProperty values belonging to the qualifying logic:onClass or logic:onDataRange. It does not count fillers outside that qualifier; it lowers to owl:minQualifiedCardinality."
msgstr "属于限定 logic:onClass 或 logic:onDataRange 的 logic:onProperty 值的含端点最小数量。限定范围外的填充值不计入，并降低为 owl:minQualifiedCardinality。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/maxQualifiedCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "maximum qualified cardinality"
msgstr "最大限定基数"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/maxQualifiedCardinality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The inclusive maximum number of logic:onProperty values belonging to the qualifying logic:onClass or logic:onDataRange. It does not count fillers outside that qualifier; it lowers to owl:maxQualifiedCardinality."
msgstr "属于限定 logic:onClass 或 logic:onDataRange 的 logic:onProperty 值的含端点最大数量。限定范围外的填充值不计入，并降低为 owl:maxQualifiedCardinality。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/onDataRange|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "on data range"
msgstr "作用于数据范围"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/onDataRange|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Names the datarange qualifying a cardinality restriction. It is not the base datatype of a logic:Datarange expression; it lowers to owl:onDataRange."
msgstr "命名限定基数限制的数据范围。它不是 logic:Datarange 表达式的基础数据类型，并降低为 owl:onDataRange。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/oneOf|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "one of"
msgstr "其中之一"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/oneOf|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Links a logic:Enumeration to the RDF list of its named members. It is not an open suggestion list; it lowers to owl:oneOf, and members may be IRIs or literals according to the enumerated expression."
msgstr "把 logic:Enumeration 连接到其具名成员的 RDF 列表。它不是开放建议列表；它降低为 owl:oneOf，成员可按枚举表达式为 IRI 或字面值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/onDatatype|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "on datatype"
msgstr "作用于数据类型"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/onDatatype|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Names the base datatype constrained by a logic:Datarange. It is not the qualifier of a cardinality restriction; it lowers to owl:onDatatype."
msgstr "命名 logic:Datarange 所约束的基础数据类型。它不是基数限制的限定条件，并降低为 owl:onDatatype。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/withRestrictions|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "with restrictions"
msgstr "带有约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/withRestrictions|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Links a logic:Datarange to the RDF list of datatype-facet restriction records it applies. It is not a list of class restrictions; it lowers to owl:withRestrictions."
msgstr "把 logic:Datarange 连接到它所应用的数据类型分面限制记录的 RDF 列表。它不是类限制列表，并降低为 owl:withRestrictions。"
